 "remarks": "Enjoy the best of downtown Greenwich living in this beautifully updated, spacious two bedroom apartment located one block from Greenwich Ave! Close to town's finest boutiques, exceptional restaurants, shops, art galleries, parks and enjoy easy access to beach ferries and Metro-North train station with only 45 min train ride to Manhattan. A desirable corner unit is one of the largest in the building. Bright and elegant interior is complimented by a brand new kitchen and beautifully renovated bathroom. Assigned parking garage space is available for additional $400. Heat and water included. Shared laundry located on the lower level. Exceptional opportunity to enjoy the convenience, easy commute, charm and vibrant lifestyle of downtown Greenwich!",
